        <briefdescription>
<para>survival probability calculation </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>implemented in terms of the default density <formula id="367">$ p(t) $</formula> as <formula id="368">\[ S(t) = 1 - \int_0^t p(\tau) d\tau. \]</formula></para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000109"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This default implementation uses numerical integration, which might be inefficient and inaccurate. Derived classes should override it if a more efficient implementation is available. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>        </detaileddescription>
